  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      204.41,
      383.84,
      229.91
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA INSTITUTE OF TAXATION(INCORPORATION) ACT, NO. 21 OF 2000",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      247.01,
      401.88,
      286.79
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation wasincorporated by the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation(Incorporation) Act, No.21 of 2000:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      303.77,
      401.88,
      343.55
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation(Incorporation) now wishes to change its name to \u201cTheChartered Institute of Taxation of Sri Lanka\u201d:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      360.65,
      401.89,
      414.59
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Sri Lanka Institute of Taxationhas now applied to have the said Act amended to give effectto such change in its name and it will be expedient to grantsuch application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      431.57,
      401.89,
      457.07
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      474.17,
      401.88,
      499.67
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Institute ofTaxation (Incorporation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      516.77,
      401.9,
      670.07
    ],
    "text": "2.In every context in which the Sri Lanka Institute ofTaxation is mentioned whether by that name or by anyabbreviation thereof in the Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation(Incorporation) Act, No. 21 of 2000 (hereinafter referred toas the principal enactment) other than in the long title ofthat Act or in any rule, notice or other document made orissued under the name of Sri Lanka Institute of Taxation,there shall, unless the context otherwise requires, besubstituted for the words \u201cSri Lanka Institute of Taxation\u201dof the words \u201cThe Chartered Institute of Taxation ofSri Lanka\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      248.59,
      443.14,
      257.66
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      475.15,
      444.58,
      484.22
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      517.63,
      455.86,
      603.5
    ],
    "text": "Generalamendmentto theSri LankaInstitute ofTaxation(Incorporation)Act, No. 21of 2000.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
