      202.61,
      401.87,
      225.47
    ],
    "text": "(c)by the repeal of the marginal note of that sectionand the substitution therefor of the following :\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
