  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      273.41,
      401.91,
      348.11
    ],
    "text": "5.Section 8 of the principal enctment is hereby amendedin paragraph (a) of subsection (1) thereof by the substitutionfor the words \u201c(a) classification of membership, fees payableby each class of member,\u201d of the words \u201c(a) classification ofmembership, issuing of certificates to members and renewalof membership, fees payable by each class of member,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      362.21,
      401.86,
      386.27
    ],
    "text": "6.Section 9 of the principal enctment is hereby repealedand the following new section is substituted therefor :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      214.89,
      400.25,
      401.9,
      500.51
    ],
    "text": "9. A Fellow of the Corporation shall beentitled to use after his name, the letters FCITand an Associate of the Corporation shall beentitled to use in like manner the letters ACIT.An Honorary Fellow or Honorary Associateshall be entitled to use the title Honorary FCITor Honorary ACIT, as the case may be, in likemanner.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      514.61,
      401.9,
      576.71
    ],
    "text": "7.Section 10 of the principal enactment is herebyamendment by the substitution for the word \u201ctitle or lettersafter his name FTII (Sri Lanka) or Honorary ATII (Sri Lanka)\u201dof the words \u201ctitle or letters FCIT, Honorary FCIT, ACIT orHonorary ACIT, as the case may be,\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      590.33,
      401.9,
      613.67
    ],
    "text": "8.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      400.15,
      203.86,
      418.82
    ],
    "text": "\u201cUse of titleafter name.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      362.11,
